  "reason": "The study reports a quantitative measure of agreement between animal results and human clinical results, specifically a 54.3% overlap of the Oncopig LC transcriptome with the human LC transcriptome, and compares this to a 29.88% overlap for a KRAS-mutant mouse LC model. This directly addresses the criteria for inclusion by quantifying translatability."
